{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）凌晨5時21分，警方接報指，一名男子昏迷受傷，倒卧在北角長康街10至18號嘉安苑對開斜路，事主隨後由救護車送往律敦治醫院進行搶救，延至同日凌晨5時53分宣告不治。警員接報到場調查，正調查事主是從上址高處墮下，抑或曾遭駛經車輛撞倒。</p><p>就現場所見，長康街19號香港教育大學北角教學中心對開馬路，遺下少量血迹，警員封鎖現場調查。據了解，事主上了年紀，上址住宅大廈的保安員未能認出事主。</p><figure><img alt=\"上址遺下少量血迹。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202142732454596608754869.jpeg/NuA_wHx9pMSnYp7KdQGdtb2mlIZ45DHhDbEN_DexDfw\"/><figcaption>上址遺下少量血迹。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202142722022969344057213.jpeg/Dpfc0W-hkw3WwLvE19xjbikTo6-WwnOEjKl1F7apdRc\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"長康街19號香港教育大學北角教學中心對開馬路，遺下少量血迹。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202142729086439424751468.jpeg/TvP1oaLF_Kx0d6m3V2OUbef_YALeBVFgIXEY4RtxGOE\"/><figcaption>長康街19號香港教育大學北角教學中心對開馬路，遺下少量血迹。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202142725600841728973210.jpeg/f1wkedQnL2pq-AAPJoFhVsU4GSQyITWtBbRFnT-0RZ0\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:04:22.119592+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:15:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:48.067112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:57:49.267115+00:00","content_hash":"a6b28a5cfabaa89b6f5dd82e4d44d3b4591236063fb44b1706261593c6e25406","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}